Package: rMosaic
Type: Package
Title: Mosaic Shiny Integration
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Timur", "Rizvanov",
      email = "timurr@bu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Embed the Mosaic framework in R, allowing users to declaratively
    define visualizations (via JSON/YAML specs) and render interactive Mosaic
    plots in Shiny. Data queries are executed in DuckDB via R, enabling scalable
    linked visuals. Includes Mosaic JavaScript libraries v0.21.1.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/TiRizvanov/rMosaic
BugReports: https://github.com/TiRizvanov/rMosaic/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    htmlwidgets (>= 1.5.4),
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0),
    yaml (>= 2.3.0),
    DBI (>= 1.1.0),
    duckdb (>= 0.8.0),
    arrow (>= 12.0.0)
